# Additional Terms (Machine Learning)

These Additional Terms clarify how the PolyForm Noncommercial
License 1.0.0 above applies to machine learning. They are part of
the terms under which the licensor offers the software.

## Machine-Learning Uses

Using the software, or any part of it, to train, fine-tune,
distill, evaluate, or benchmark a machine-learning model, or to
build a dataset, embedding, or index for any of those purposes,
is use for a permitted purpose only if that use is for a
noncommercial purpose under the license above. "The software"
includes its source code, documentation, and any data files the
licensor distributes with it.

## Commercial Machine-Learning Uses

A machine-learning use is not for a noncommercial purpose if the
model, dataset, or anything built from it is, or is intended to
be, sold, licensed, offered for a fee, offered together with
advertising, or used in or for a product, service, or operation
of a company or other organization that is not covered by the
Noncommercial Organizations section above. Research, experiment,
and testing that meet the Personal Uses or Noncommercial
Organizations sections remain permitted.

## Collection

Automatically collecting the software, for example by crawling or
scraping, in order to make a use that these terms do not permit
is not a permitted purpose.

## Resulting Works

A model, dataset, or other work made by a use that these terms do
not permit is not a change or new work permitted by the Changes
and New Works License.

## Fair Use Preserved

As the Fair Use section above says, these Additional Terms do not
limit any "fair use" or other rights you have under the law.

## Separate Permission

The licensor may give permission for a machine-learning use that
these terms do not permit, in writing, to any person.
